{"id":"8862b10f6e040c16","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-pi2-formula.md","title":"Pi 2 Formula","display":"df-pi2-formula — Pi_2 Formula","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-pi2-formula","aliases":["92-df-pi2-formula"],"display":"df-pi2-formula — Pi_2 Formula","depends_on":["[[92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]","[[92-df-formula]]"],"source":"本地算术层级定义；可对照原书第 IV 章 pp.43–48 对 Σ1 公式与算术集合的讨论；完整 Σn/Πn 层级是背景扩展","source_status":"原书相关背景的本地层级定义"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-pi2-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-pi2-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pi2-formula — Pi_2 Formula"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7ce1b12990ae9469\" href=\"?note=7ce1b12990ae9469\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy\">92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"本地算术层级定义；可对照原书第 IV 章 pp.43–48 对 Σ1 公式与算术集合的讨论；完整 Σn/Πn 层级是背景扩展"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书相关背景的本地层级定义"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (formula, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_2^G\">\\(\\Pi_2^G\\)</span> (second universal level, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7ce1b12990ae9469\" href=\"?note=7ce1b12990ae9469\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy\">92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PiTwo}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{PiTwo}_G\\)</span> (definition-target predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pi2\\text{-}formula} \\vdash \\mathrm{PiTwo}_G(\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\varphi\\in\\Pi_2^G\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pi2\\text{-}formula} \\vdash \\mathrm{PiTwo}_G(\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\varphi\\in\\Pi_2^G\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>按<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7ce1b12990ae9469\" href=\"?note=7ce1b12990ae9469\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy\">92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy</a>的约定，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_2^G\">\\(\\Pi_2^G\\)</span>包含与“全称量词块+<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>公式”逻辑等价的全部公式，而不只包含字面前束串</li>\n<li>在标准有效句子编码下，全部真<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_2\">\\(\\Pi_2\\)</span>句的码集具有Turing度<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf 0&#39;&#39;\">\\(\\mathbf 0&#39;&#39;\\)</span>（它与假<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_2\">\\(\\Sigma_2\\)</span>句码集互补）；这里说的是句子码集而不是含任意自由变量的公式类</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_2\">\\(\\Pi_2\\)</span>层次用于描述算术真理的复杂层次</li>\n<li>在不一致性强度分析中重要</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"7ce1b12990ae9469","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_G$ (formula, see [[92-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"7ce1b12990ae9469","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Pi_2^G$ (second universal level, see [[92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"7ce1b12990ae9469","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"按[[92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]的约定，$\\Pi_2^G$包含与“全称量词块+$\\Sigma_1$公式”逻辑等价的全部公式，而不只包含字面前束串","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_2^G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PiTwo}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pi2\\text{-}formula} \\vdash \\mathrm{PiTwo}_G(\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\varphi\\in\\Pi_2^G","display":true},{"tex":"\\Pi_2^G","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf 0''","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_2","display":false}],"bytes":1312,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-123","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-pi2-formula]]"}],"outgoing":["7ce1b12990ae9469","5a1bd470754681a7"]}